  "id": "problem-solving-therapy",
  "term": "problem-solving therapy",
  "definition": "Problem-solving therapy is a counselling approach designed to reduce mental health difficulties by strengthening a person’s ability to deal with problems. It encourages a more hopeful, confident attitude toward problems and teaches a step-by-step method of identifying a problem, generating options, choosing a promising solution, trying it out, and reviewing the result.",
